321
18:42.310 --> 18:42.950
Which one?

322
18:43.270 --> 18:44.730
Which looks better?

323
18:46.920 --> 18:48.780
I think both styles would suit you.

324
18:48.780 --> 18:50.880
Aw, you're such a smooth talker!

325
18:50.900 --> 18:51.990
Ren.

326
18:52.020 --> 18:53.360
Have you finished your report?

327
18:53.360 --> 18:54.740
Oh, not yet.

328
18:54.770 --> 18:56.370
By the way, I have work today.

329
18:57.890 --> 18:58.850
What about hair color?

330
18:58.850 --> 19:03.240
-Do I look better blonde or black? -Exactly! Exactly!

331
19:03.280 --> 19:03.830
What?

332
19:03.850 --> 19:04.870
Blonde or...

333
19:04.890 --> 19:06.260
Welcome!

334
19:06.290 --> 19:07.540
Thank you. Come again!

335
19:07.540 --> 19:08.950
I'd like some pancakes.

336
19:08.980 --> 19:10.600
One order of pancakes.

337
19:10.620 --> 19:12.200
Could you take this, please?

338
19:12.200 --> 19:13.410
Sure.

339
19:13.430 --> 19:16.390
Why am I stuck working in the kitchen?

340
19:21.750 --> 19:23.120
Thank you.

341
19:23.140 --> 19:25.100
-Watch your step, please. -Okay.

342
19:25.670 --> 19:26.910
Sorry to keep you waiting.

343
19:26.910 --> 19:28.150
-Here's your order. -Thank you.

344
19:28.150 --> 19:30.740
-Thanks! You're still so handsome today! -You're too kind.

345
19:30.740 --> 19:31.390
Hahaha!

346
19:31.420 --> 19:31.960
Thank you for coming!

347
19:31.960 --> 19:33.560
Thank you for always taking such good care of me.

348
19:33.560 --> 19:35.130
Oh, I'm still missing one matcha salad.

349
19:35.130 --> 19:36.970
-Oh, sorry! Thank you. -Oh, really?

350
19:36.970 --> 19:38.310
Wait a moment, please.

351
19:38.330 --> 19:40.310
You're so handsome!

352
19:49.120 --> 19:50.740
I love this! I really do!

353
19:50.760 --> 19:52.470
Amazing!

354
19:52.940 --> 19:56.100
-Your turn! -What're you doing?

355
19:56.130 --> 19:57.600
-Go for it! -Go for it!

356
19:57.630 --> 19:59.240
-Come on! -Say something!

357
19:59.270 --> 20:01.670
-Let's toast to today! -Cheers!

358
20:01.700 --> 20:02.680
All right!

359
20:02.710 --> 20:04.930
-Cheers! -Cheers!

360
20:04.960 --> 20:07.440
Whenever I'm with that guy,

361
20:07.460 --> 20:09.910
I'm always stuck playing second fiddle.

362
20:09.930 --> 20:11.480
What are you talking about?

363
20:11.500 --> 20:13.870
Stop! Don't say another word.

364
20:14.520 --> 20:15.270
Um...

365
20:15.300 --> 20:16.600
-So pretty! -Hahaha!

366
20:17.940 --> 20:20.220
Everyone, listen up!

367
20:21.910 --> 20:23.530
Really beautiful.

368
20:23.560 --> 20:26.310
Yeah, only a freshman.

369
20:26.340 --> 20:28.420
I'm serious. I really mean it.

370
20:28.450 --> 20:29.670
-Really? -Hey.

371
20:29.700 --> 20:32.850
Can we exchange contacts?

372
20:32.880 --> 20:34.490
Oh, sure!

373
20:34.510 --> 20:35.740
Ah, me too.

374
20:35.760 --> 20:36.430
One more year.

375
20:36.430 --> 20:36.760
Done.

376
20:36.770 --> 20:37.520
Did you get it?

377
20:37.520 --> 20:38.200
Got it.

378
20:38.220 --> 20:38.990
Thanks.

379
20:39.010 --> 20:39.740
Oh, I'm Ren.

380
20:39.760 --> 20:41.160
Okay, thanks.

381
20:41.180 --> 20:42.060
Let me help you.

382
20:42.090 --> 20:44.320
You're a cosmetology student, right? Yeah, a cosmetology student.

383
20:44.320 --> 20:45.230
Thanks.

384
20:45.260 --> 20:49.400
Just dye it red. That's all.

385
20:58.310 --> 21:01.380
What? He hasn't even contacted me.

386
21:03.860 --> 21:05.960
I feel like such an idiot.

387
21:14.640 --> 21:15.700
Morning!

388
21:15.720 --> 21:17.490
Thanks for coming to the mixer the other day.

389
21:17.490 --> 21:18.450
No, I should be thanking you.

390
21:18.450 --> 21:20.970
Oh, how are things going with that girl from before?

391
21:20.970 --> 21:22.100
It's not happening.

392
21:22.120 --> 21:24.160
How about you? Why aren't you with Kuji today?

393
21:24.160 --> 21:25.580
Oh, it's nothing.

394
21:25.600 --> 21:27.170
Hahaha!

395
21:27.190 --> 21:28.770
Oh, come on!

396
21:28.800 --> 21:31.410
That look on his face...

397
21:33.880 --> 21:35.350
Aren't you going to go say hi?

398
21:35.350 --> 21:36.850
I told you, it's nothing!

399
21:36.870 --> 21:38.800
I'm going for it!

400
21:38.820 --> 21:41.560
I mean it. I've decided to take a chance.

401
21:41.590 --> 21:42.740
Thank you. Seriously, thank you!

402
21:42.740 --> 21:44.140
I've decided to go all in.

403
21:46.990 --> 21:47.890
Hey!

404
21:53.460 --> 21:55.360
That's my spot.

405
22:06.160 --> 22:07.550
I mean...

406
22:07.800 --> 22:09.690
Issei is my partner.

407
22:09.710 --> 22:10.930
Right?

408
22:12.170 --> 22:13.230
Hehe.

409
22:13.250 --> 22:14.790
What's going on?

410
22:14.810 --> 22:17.590
You don't have to be so lovey-dovey. We get it already!

411
22:17.590 --> 22:19.560
You scared me, suddenly going all out like that. Cut it out!

412
22:19.560 --> 22:20.690
Hehe. My bad, my bad.

413
22:22.270 --> 22:24.470
You can borrow my report and take a look.

414
22:24.680 --> 22:26.330
You haven't even started writing yours yet, have you?

415
22:26.330 --> 22:28.190
Hey, Issei.

416
22:39.690 --> 22:42.870
What's this? A kabedon?

417
22:43.150 --> 22:46.610
There's no one here. What's the point of putting on such a show?

418
22:49.000 --> 22:50.330
I didn't know back then.

419
22:54.240 --> 22:56.840
I didn't know you were pretending to be asleep.

420
22:59.220 --> 23:01.280
I had no idea you were actually awake.

421
23:02.780 --> 23:05.640
I only kissed you because I thought you were asleep.

422
23:13.340 --> 23:14.770
Guess why.

423
23:38.080 --> 23:39.640
What are you doing?

424
23:40.170 --> 23:41.090
Listen...

425
23:41.110 --> 23:44.040
There's not a single person watching. If you do this,

426
23:44.050 --> 23:46.850
people will laugh their heads off if they find out.

427
23:49.380 --> 23:51.830
Then why not stop treating it like a joke?

428
23:56.400 --> 23:58.210
Oh, I see.

429
23:59.090 --> 24:01.950
Then let's do it once. This time, I'll do it your way.

430
24:02.230 --> 24:05.830
Once I've given you what you want, you have to forget all about it.

431
24:06.420 --> 24:07.300
Oh, but...

432
24:08.780 --> 24:09.460
I...

433
24:09.920 --> 24:11.920
I don't know how to hold another guy.

434
24:17.620 --> 24:18.950
It's okay, Ren.

435
24:20.260 --> 24:22.120
You don't have to hold back at all.

436
24:43.310 --> 24:45.600
About what happened yesterday...

437
24:43.640 --> 24:47.030
[Coming Up Next]

438
24:45.620 --> 24:46.590
Huh? What?

439
24:47.720 --> 24:48.570
Huh? What?

440
24:48.600 --> 24:49.760
Am I a mosquito or something?

441
24:49.760 --> 24:52.220
To him, was it just like getting bitten by a mosquito?

442
24:52.220 --> 24:53.720
That Ren, honestly...

443
24:53.740 --> 24:55.380
Ah.

444
24:55.400 --> 24:56.710
Let the show begin!

445
24:55.860 --> 24:56.770
[Let the Show Begin]

446
24:56.740 --> 24:58.820
Come inside and wash off all that filth.

447
24:58.820 --> 25:00.240
Does this guy

448
24:59.960 --> 25:03.000
[This drama is entirely fictional]

449
25:00.270 --> 25:01.960
belong to me now?
